      "variants": [
        {
          "op": "replace",
          "id": "engaged-columns-and-pediment",
          "status": "forbidden",
          "note": "c05: 'Entry treatment limited to a pilastered surround or a small pedimented hood not exceeding 6'0\" in width.' Engaged columns are neither. colonial-revival's own binding permits them on its defining_characteristics[1]; this node narrows it, and defining_characteristics[3] asks for 'a modest pedimented hood or pilastered surround'."
