      "judgment": false,
      "rule_append": "Entry treatment limited to a pilastered surround or a small pedimented hood not exceeding 6'0\" in width -- c05. A two-storey portico is incompatible with a jettied elevation.",
      "note": "WP-16.2 (30 Sep 2026): this delta now merges onto colonial-revival's own `specified` door_surround, which makes `pilasters-and-entablature` canonical -- the 'pilastered surround' c05 names -- and permits `engaged-columns-and-pediment`, which c05's 'limited to' rules out here. Requires colonial-revival's binding: before it, no ancestor defines the row this `replace` targets."
    },
